      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a draft for a new museum policy document about how we handle our historical collections. We need a section that summarizes the ongoing debate regarding whether artifacts should be returned to their countries of origin or kept in large universal museums. Can you write a summary of the two main viewpoints so we can include it in the preamble?",
